    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "14a7da5b963fdd265d4e": "Okay, well... don't get cocky! Since you have demonstrated  your competence though, we may now begin!",
        "43e0c483917e536a1ca0": "Who are you? What do you want from me?",
        "886a1051ae24fd43837c": "Great, let's get started... ha! Fooled you! Surely you didn't think it would be that simple. You'll need to prove your mettle just like everyone else!",
        "93e0d8ab334b6069e4c4": "You're joking, right? I believe you're looking for the OTHER short fellow, Thonys Pillarstone. He's downstairs. Now skedaddle!",
        "9a6ab8c89019846c0f2e": "What do I look like, the Grand Poobah of enchanters? Your skills require the guidance of an Artisan! Go find Kitta Firewind at the Tower of Azora.",
        "d04c9f5cded6a398710f": "Train me."
      },
      "name": "Gimble Thistlefuzz",
      "subName": "Expert Enchanter",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
